// Title: MSSQL XPCmdshell Suspicious Execution
// ID: 7f103213-a04e-4d59-8261-213dddf22314
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-07-12
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects when the MSSQL "xp_cmdshell" stored procedure is used to execute commands
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where (Provider_Name matches "*MSSQL*" and EventID = "33205" and (Data matches "*object_name:xp_cmdshell*" and Data matches "*statement:EXEC*"))
